{
	"name": "Create a QR code for every row in a Google Sheet",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## One QR code per sheet row\n\nReads a Google Sheet, creates a dynamic URL QR code in [OpenQR.io](https://openqr.io) for each row, saves the SVG to Google Drive and writes the code's ID and image link back to the row.\n\n### Setup\n1. Make a sheet with the columns **name**, **url**, **qr_code_id** and **image_url**. Names need 5 to 255 characters.\n2. Pick the sheet in **Read Rows** and **Write Back ID**.\n3. Pick a Drive folder in **Save to Drive**.\n4. Add your OpenQR.io API key: dashboard.openqr.io, user menu, API Keys.\n\n### Limits\nOpenQR.io allows 60 creates a minute. The loop sends 10 rows, then waits 10 seconds. Every code counts towards your plan, so check **qr_codes_remaining** with Account > Get Plan Usage before a big sheet.\n\nKeep **qr_code_id**: Update needs it to change where a code points later.",
				"height": 560,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "87b6c00d-a637-4f2d-9229-72d99bba8297",
			"name": "About",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-460, -260]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
			"id": "5144640f-5255-4507-a9d8-4f4c182d4517",
			"name": "Start",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [0, 0]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "sheet",
				"operation": "read",
				"documentId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": ""
				},
				"sheetName": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": ""
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "25ba1eb6-9fe2-4f60-bc74-6765ff3b7f38",
			"name": "Read Rows",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
			"typeVersion": 4.7,
			"position": [220, 0]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"batchSize": 10,
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "dee1ae5a-4c9a-4600-b2e9-dc0fd2b6db84",
			"name": "Loop Over Rows",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
			"typeVersion": 3,
			"position": [440, 0]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "qrCode",
				"operation": "create",
				"name": "={{ $json.name }}",
				"type": "url",
				"url": "={{ $json.url }}",
				"options": {},
				"design": {},
				"downloadImage": true,
				"binaryPropertyName": "data"
			},
			"id": "2e01e6ec-dc05-4230-87c7-fa83f61e4b6e",
			"name": "Create QR Code",
			"type": "@openqr-io/n8n-nodes-openqr.openQrIo",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [680, 80]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "file",
				"operation": "upload",
				"inputDataFieldName": "data",
				"name": "={{ $binary.data.fileName }}",
				"driveId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": "My Drive"
				},
				"folderId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": "root",
					"cachedResultName": "/ (Root folder)"
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "d41b136c-9f95-4769-a1e2-049ed0bfd56b",
			"name": "Save to Drive",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
			"typeVersion": 3,
			"position": [900, 80]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "sheet",
				"operation": "update",
				"documentId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": ""
				},
				"sheetName": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "list",
					"value": ""
				},
				"columns": {
					"mappingMode": "defineBelow",
					"value": {
						"row_number": "={{ $('Loop Over Rows').item.json.row_number }}",
						"qr_code_id": "={{ $('Create QR Code').item.json.id }}",
						"image_url": "={{ $('Create QR Code').item.json.image }}"
					},
					"matchingColumns": ["row_number"],
					"schema": [
						{
							"id": "row_number",
							"displayName": "row_number",
							"required": false,
							"defaultMatch": false,
							"display": true,
							"type": "string",
							"canBeUsedToMatch": true,
							"readOnly": true
						},
						{
							"id": "qr_code_id",
							"displayName": "qr_code_id",
							"required": false,
							"defaultMatch": false,
							"display": true,
							"type": "string",
							"canBeUsedToMatch": true
						},
						{
							"id": "image_url",
							"displayName": "image_url",
							"required": false,
							"defaultMatch": false,
							"display": true,
							"type": "string",
							"canBeUsedToMatch": true
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "a079c8de-c87a-46d8-a560-7bb3721b262c",
			"name": "Write Back ID",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
			"typeVersion": 4.7,
			"position": [1120, 80]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"amount": 10
			},
			"id": "dd795f8e-98b3-4998-9ebe-100166e51c51",
			"name": "Wait 10 Seconds",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [1340, 80],
			"webhookId": "d70e0116-ba4c-4fae-8cf5-1e2b0834bb61"
		}
	],
